#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1235 expect=violation domain=DU
#note "row 1 leaves both SPDEVID and USUBJID present-and-empty -> fires."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 DUSEQ=1
dataset DU label="Device In-Use"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col SPDEVID type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col DUSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DUTESTCD type=Char label="Device In-Use Short Name"
---
S1 | DU |  |  | 1 | SETTING
S1 | DU | DEV-01 |  | 2 | SETTING
